## 8. DATOVÝ MODEL (Room + Supabase mapping)

Lokální databáze **Room** běží nad **SQLCipher** (`SupportFactory(sqlCipherKey)`). Navrhni čisté mapování mezi lokálními Room entitami, doménovými modely a šifrovanými Supabase DTO objekty (`vault_objects`, `vault_files`, `vault_audit`, `vault_sync_log`).

### Lokální Room entity a doménové struktury:
1. **`NoteEntity` (`object_type = 'note'`):**
   - `id: String (UUID)`, `vaultId: String`, `collectionId: String?` (`parent_id`), `title: String`, `body: String`, `tagsJson: String` (`List<String>`), `attachmentsJson: String` (`List<String>` – ID souborů), `eventLinksJson: String` (`List<String>` – ID událostí), `historyJson: String` (`List<NoteRevision>`), `isPinned: Boolean`, `isFavorite: Boolean`, `color: String?`, `templateName: String?`, `createdAt: Long`, `updatedAt: Long`, `deletedAt: Long?`, `rev: Long`.
2. **`PasswordEntity` (`object_type = 'password'`):**
   - `id: String (UUID)`, `vaultId: String`, `collectionId: String?`, `title: String`, `username: String`, `encryptedPassword: String` (nebo v šifrované SQLCipher DB + chráněné přes `SecurityGate`), `url: String`, `totpSecret: String?`, `notes: String`, `category: String`, `strengthScore: Int`, `isFavorite: Boolean`, `expiresAt: Long?`, `lastChangedAt: Long`, `createdAt: Long`, `updatedAt: Long`, `deletedAt: Long?`, `rev: Long`.
3. **`CalendarEventEntity` (`object_type = 'event'`):**
   - `id: String (UUID)`, `vaultId: String`, `title: String`, `description: String`, `startAt: Long`, `endAt: Long`, `allDay: Boolean`, `remindersJson: String` (`List<Int>` – minuty předem), `recurrenceRule: String` (`NONE`, `DAILY`, `WEEKLY`, `MONTHLY`, `YEARLY`), `linkedNotesJson: String` (`List<String>`), `linkedRecordsJson: String` (`List<String>`), `systemCalendarEventId: Long?`, `color: String?`, `createdAt: Long`, `updatedAt: Long`, `deletedAt: Long?`, `rev: Long`.
4. **`VaultFileEntity` (mapováno na `vault_files` + Storage bucket `vault-files`):**
   - `id: String (UUID)`, `vaultId: String`, `folderId: String?`, `storagePath: String` (`{vault_id}/{file_id}.enc`), `encryptedMetadata: ByteArray` (obsahuje JSON s `fileName`, `mimeType`, `sha256Hex`, `folderId`, `thumbnailBase64`, `linkedObjectIds`), `metadataNonce: ByteArray`, `decryptedFileName: String`, `mimeType: String`, `sizeBytes: Long`, `localEncryptedPath: String?`, `sha256Hex: String`, `createdAt: Long`, `updatedAt: Long`, `deletedAt: Long?`, `rev: Long`.
5. **`UserDatabaseEntity` (`object_type = 'database'`):**
   - `id: String (UUID)`, `vaultId: String`, `name: String`, `description: String`, `icon: String`, `schemaJson: String` (`List<DatabaseFieldSchema>`), `createdAt: Long`, `updatedAt: Long`, `deletedAt: Long?`, `rev: Long`.
6. **`DatabaseRecordEntity` (`object_type = 'record'`, `parent_id = database_id`):**
   - `id: String (UUID)`, `vaultId: String`, `databaseId: String`, `valuesJson: String` (`Map<String, JsonElement>`), `isFavorite: Boolean`, `createdAt: Long`, `updatedAt: Long`, `deletedAt: Long?`, `rev: Long`.
7. **`CollectionEntity` (`object_type = 'collection'`):**
   - `id: String (UUID)`, `vaultId: String`, `parentId: String?`, `name: String`, `icon: String`, `color: String?`, `sortOrder: Int`, `createdAt: Long`, `updatedAt: Long`, `deletedAt: Long?`, `rev: Long`.
8. **`AuditEntryEntity` (mapováno na `vault_audit`):**
   - `id: Long`, `remoteId: Long?`, `vaultId: String`, `actionType: String`, `targetObjectId: String?`, `summary: String`, `deviceInfo: String`, `encryptedPayload: ByteArray`, `nonce: ByteArray`, `createdAt: Long`, `isSynced: Boolean`.
9. **`SyncQueueEntity` (lokální offline fronta):**
   - `id: Long (autoGenerate)`, `tableName: String` (`vaults`, `vault_objects`, `vault_files`, `vault_audit`), `objectId: String`, `action: String` (`upsert`, `delete`), `payloadJson: String`, `rev: Long`, `retries: Int`, `lastError: String?`, `createdAt: Long`.

### Mapování do Supabase (`vault_objects`):
Při odesílání jakéhokoli objektu (`Note`, `Password`, `CalendarEvent`, `UserDatabase`, `DatabaseRecord`, `Collection`) do Supabase:
1. Doménový objekt se serializuje do JSONu (`kotlinx.serialization`).
2. JSON bajty se zašifrují přes `SecurityGate.encrypt(plainBytes)` → vznikne `encryptedPayload: ByteArray` a `nonce: ByteArray` (12 bajtů).
3. Do tabulky `vault_objects` se odešle pouze: `id`, `vault_id`, `object_type`, `parent_id`, `encrypted_payload` (`\x...`), `nonce` (`\x...`), `rev`, `deleted_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`.
4. Současně se zapíše záznam o změně do `vault_sync_log` (`vault_id`, `object_id`, `table_name`, `action`, `rev`).

